# sprechblase=: eine Zeile = eine Seite der Sprechblase (ersetzt den Text des Spiels, wenn man sie anspricht)
sprechblase=Welcome, traveller. Let me tell you the story of this land.
sprechblase=Long ago the High Elves watched over these lands. Their magic protected every forest, mountain and shore.
sprechblase=Their temples are magical portals. Once they connected all corners of the land with one another.
sprechblase=But the High Elves vanished, and with them their magic. Now the whole land is scrambled into pieces.
sprechblase=Find our king, the last of the High Elves. He will reward you with great gifts.
